[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700500_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700500_01_0010","text":"──……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700500_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700500_01_0020","text":"路加酱，辛苦了～\n刚才在放新歌对吧？我也可以在后面一起跳吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700500_01_0030","text":"……随你便"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700500_01_0040","text":"啊哈，谢啦\n那我就不客气了──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700500_01_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700500_01_0050","text":"────────……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700500_01_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700500_01_0060","text":"路加？\n我是不是打扰到你了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700500_01_0070","text":"没什么……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700500_01_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700500_01_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700500_01_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700500_01_0009","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700500_01_0080","text":"我为了不打扰你，还特意放轻了脚步……\n还是太吵了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700500_01_0090","text":"…………\n我回去了──────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700500_01_0008","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700500_01_0100","text":"果然，还是打扰到她了吧……？"}]
